⍝ Start the combined Jarvis demo from the shell (repository root):
⍝     dyalogscript Samples/LiveDemo/start.apls
⍝ then browse to http://localhost:8080. The server runs until the process is interrupted (Ctrl+C).
⍝ Loads Source/Jarvis.dyalog (relative to this script) and the settings in jarvisconfig.json.
